## Citations of the Dataset
Global Electronics Retail dataset is from Muhammad Faheem Iqbal taken from kaggle from the
url: https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/faheem113141/global-electronics-retail
The following MIT license text is taken from
https://www.mit.edu/ amini/LICENSE.md which is the link that is con-
nected to the dataset on kaggle.
